102:\"<pre>Title</pre><pre>Type</pre><pre>Meta Name</pre><pre class=\\\"wppb-mb-head-required\\\">Required</pre>\";i:2063;s:69:\"Use these shortcodes on the pages you want the forms to be displayed:\";i:2064;s:162:\"If you\'re interested in displaying different fields in the registration and edit profile forms, please use the Multiple Registration & Edit Profile Forms Modules.\";i:2065;s:162:\"With Profile Builder Pro you can display different fields in the registration and edit profile forms, using the Multiple Registration & Edit Profile Forms module.\";i:2066;s:15:\"Search Location\";i:2067;s:13:\"Paid Accounts\";i:2068;s:51:\"Paid Member Subscriptions - a free WordPress plugin\";i:2069;s:128:\"With the new Subscriptions Field in Profile Builder, your registration forms will allow your users to sign up for paid accounts.\";i:2070;s:25:\"Paid & Free Subscriptions\";i:2071;s:16:\"Restrict Content\";i:2072;s:17:\"Member Management\";i:2073;s:15:\"Email Templates\";i:2074;s:18:\"Account Management\";i:2075;s:23:\"Subscription Management\";i:2076;s:18:\"Payment Management\";i:2077;s:16:\"Plugin is Active\";i:2078;s:25:\"Plugin has been activated\";i:2079;s:28:\"Plugin has been deactivated.\";i:2080;s:85:\"Accept user payments, create subscription plans and restrict content on your website.\";i:2081;s:24:\"Step by Step Quick Setup\";i:2082;s:116:\"Allow your users to have <strong>paid accounts with Profile Builder</strong>. %1$sFind out how >%2$s %3$sDismiss%4$s\";i:2083;s:24:\"Private Website Settings\";i:2084;s:22:\"Enable Private Website\";i:2085;s:89:\"Activate Private Website. It will restrict the content, RSS and REST API for your website\";i:2086;s:11:\"Redirect to\";i:2087;s:28:\"Default WordPress login page\";i:2088;s:100:\"Redirects to this page if not logged in. We recommend this page contains the [wppb-login] shortcode.\";i:2089;s:99:\"You can force access to wp-login.php so you don\'t get locked out of the site by accessing the link:\";i:2090;s:13:\"Allowed Pages\";i:2091;s:62:\"Allow these pages to be accessed even if you are not logged in\";i:2092;s:14:\"Hide all Menus\";i:2093;s:45:\"Hide all menu items if you are not logged in.\";i:2094;s:147:\"We recommend \\\"<a href=\\\"%s\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Custom Profile Menus</a>\\\" addon if you need different menu items for logged in / logged out users.\";i:2095;s:21:\"Register Your Version\";i:2096;s:16:\"Register Version\";i:2097;s:24:\"Profile Builder Register\";i:2098;s:27:\"Register your version of %s\";i:2099;s:112:\"Now that you acquired a copy of %s, you should take the time and register it with the serial number you received\";i:2100;s:127:\"If you register this version of Profile Builder, you\'ll receive information regarding upgrades, patches, and technical support.\";i:2101;s:15:\" Serial Number:\";i:2102;s:45:\"The serial number was successfully validated!\";i:2103;s:48:\"The serial number entered couldn\'t be validated!\";i:2104;s:42:\"The serial number is about to expire soon!\";i:2105;s:75:\" Your serial number is about to expire, please %1$s Renew Your License%2$s.\";i:2106;s:59:\"The serial number couldn\'t be validated because it expired!\";i:2107;s:67:\" Your serial number is expired, please %1$s Renew Your License%2$s.\";i:2108;s:137:\"The serial number couldn\'t be validated because process timed out. This is possible due to the server being down. Please try again later!\";i:2109;s:50:\"(e.g. RMPB-15-SN-253a55baa4fbe7bf595b2aabb8d72985)\";i:2110;s:217:\"<p>Your <strong>Profile Builder</strong> serial number is invalid or missing. <br/>Please %1$sregister your copy%2$s to receive access to automatic updates and support. Need a license key? %3$sPurchase one now%4$s</p>\";i:2111;s:241:\"<p>Your <strong>Profile Builder</strong> license has expired. <br/>Please %1$sRenew Your Licence%2$s to continue receiving access to product downloads, automatic updates and support. %3$sRenew now and get 40&#37; off %4$s %5$sDismiss%6$s</p>\";i:2112;s:256:\"<p>Your <strong>Profile Builder</strong> license is about to expire on %5$s. <br/>Please %1$sRenew Your Licence%2$s to continue receiving access to product downloads, automatic updates and support. %3$sRenew now and get 40&#37; off %4$s %6$sDismiss%7$s</p>\";i:2113;s:18:\"Strength indicator\";i:2114;s:32:\"Minimum length of %d characters.\";i:2115;s:114:\"You will soon be redirected automatically. If you see this page for more than %1$d seconds, please click %2$s.%3$s\";i:2116;s:63:\"No feed available,please visit our <a href=\\\"%s\\\">homepage</a>!\";i:2117;s:32:\"You are not currently logged in.\";i:2118;s:132:\"The role of the created user set to the default role. Only an administrator can register a user with the role assigned to this form.\";i:2119;s:40:\"Only an administrator can add new users.\";i:2120;s:68:\"Users can register themselves or you can manually create users here.\";i:2121;s:46:\"This message is only visible by administrators\";i:2122;s:83:\"Users cannot currently register themselves, but you can manually create users here.\";i:2123;s:24:\"Log out of this account.\";i:2124;s:43:\"You must be logged in to edit your profile.\";i:2125;s:40:\"There was an error in the submitted form\";i:2126;s:33:\"Send these credentials via email.\";i:2127;s:38:\"The password you entered is incorrect.\";i:2128;s:24:\"Password Lost and Found.\";i:2129;s:18:\"Lost your password\";i:2130;s:17:\"Invalid username.\";i:2131;s:8:\"username\";i:2132;s:5:\"email\";i:2133;s:17:\"username or email\";i:2134;s:22:\"Both fields are empty.\";i:2135;s:17:\"Username or Email\";i:2136;s:19:\"Lost your password?\";i:2137;s:7:\"Log out\";i:2138;s:41:\"You are currently logged in as %1$s. %2$s\";i:2139;s:103:\"Your account has to be confirmed by an administrator before you can use the \\\"Password Reset\\\" feature.\";i:2140;s:59:\"You will receive a link to create a new password via email.\";i:2141;s:50:\"The username entered wasn\'t found in the database!\";i:2142;s:51:\"Please check that you entered the correct username.\";i:2143;s:55:\"The email address entered wasn\'t found in the database!\";i:2144;s:56:\"Please check that you entered the correct email address.\";i:2145;s:28:\"Password Reset from \\\"%1$s\\\"\";i:2146;s:48:\"Password Successfully Reset for %1$s on \\\"%2$s\\\"\";i:2147;s:34:\"The entered passwords don\'t match!\";i:2148;s:6:\"ERROR:\";i:2149;s:12:\"Invalid key!\";i:2150;s:23:\"Invalid activation key!\";i:2151;s:28:\"This username is now active!\";i:2152;s:22:\"Could not create user!\";i:2153;s:35:\"This username is already activated!\";i:2154;s:38:\"Your email was successfully confirmed.\";i:2155;s:105:\"Before you can access your account, an administrator needs to approve it. You will be notified via email.\";i:2156;s:53:\"There was an error while trying to activate the user.\";i:2157;s:30:\"Users successfully unapproved!\";i:2158;s:27:\"Users successfully deleted!\";i:2159;s:106:\"Your account has to be confirmed by an administrator before you can use the \\\"Password Recovery\\\" feature.\";i:2160;s:97:\"The approval link is not valid! Please <a href=\\\"%s\\\"> log in </a> to approve the user manually. \";i:2161;s:17:\"delete this user?\";i:2162;s:20:\"unapprove this user?\";i:2163;s:18:\"approve this user?\";i:2164;s:100:\"Checking only \\\"Logged In Users\\\" will show this %s to all logged in users, regardless of user role.\";i:2165;s:24:\"If you select \\\"Message\\\";i:2166;s:25:\"If you select \\\"Redirect\\\";i:2167;s:45:\"Show the first %s words of the post\'s content\";i:2168;s:40:\"Show the content before the \\\"more\\\" tag\";i:2169;s:20:\"[%1$s] Activate %2$s\";i:2170;s:152:\"To activate your user, please click the following link:<br><br>%s%s%s<br><br>After you activate it you will receive yet *another email* with your login.\";i:2171;s:35:\"That username is already activated!\";i:2172;s:52:\"There was an error while trying to activate the user\";i:2173;s:39:\"A new subscriber has (been) registered!\";i:2174;s:6