s.\";i:2334;s:30:\"Please enter a valid username.\";i:2335;s:50:\"This username is already reserved to be used soon.\";i:2336;s:50:\"Please add the Google Maps API key for this field.\";i:2337;s:39:\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\";i:2338;s:25:\"Please enter numbers only\";i:2339;s:34:\"Value must be a multiplier of %1$s\";i:2340;s:43:\"Value must be greater than or equal to %1$s\";i:2341;s:40:\"Value must be less than or equal to %1$s\";i:2342;s:5:\"Limit\";i:2343;s:81:\"Enable limit to the number of fields to be generated by users in front end forms \";i:2344;s:13:\"General Limit\";i:2345;s:65:\"Default limit for this repeater group. <br>Leave 0 for unlimited.\";i:2346;s:21:\"Limit reached message\";i:2347;s:46:\"The maximum number of fields has been reached.\";i:2348;s:74:\"The popup message to display when the limit of repeater groups is reached.\";i:2349;s:14:\"Limit per Role\";i:2350;s:22:\"Leave 0 for unlimited.\";i:2351;s:20:\"Repeated field group\";i:2352;s:56:\"Manage field or group of fields that will be repeatable.\";i:2353;s:24:\"Repeatable fields saved!\";i:2354;s:34:\"Please enter a unique field title.\";i:2355;s:36:\"Please enter a unique field title.\\n\";i:2356;s:10:\"Version %s\";i:2357;s:125:\"Give us another try! Open a support ticket <a href=\'https://www.cozmoslabs.com/support/open-ticket/\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a>\";i:2358;s:31:\"\"Email Confirmation\" Activated:\";i:2359;s:143:\"This works with front-end forms only. Recommended to redirect WP default registration to a Profile Builder one using \"Custom Redirects\" module.\";i:2360;s:34:\"\"Email Confirmation\" Landing Page:\";i:2361;s:27:\"\"Admin Approval\" Activated:\";i:2362;s:30:\"\"Admin Approval\" on User Role:\";i:2363;s:25:\"\"Roles Editor\" Activated:\";i:2364;s:25:\"\"Admin Approval\" Feature:\";i:2365;s:69:\"\"Username and Email\" - users can Log In with both Username and Email.\";i:2366;s:49:\"\"Username\" - users can Log In only with Username.\";i:2367;s:43:\"\"Email\" - users can Log In only with Email.\";i:2368;s:100:\"You can force access to wp-login.php so you don\\\'t get locked out of the site by accessing the link:\";i:2369;s:141:\"We recommend \"<a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Profile Menus</a>\" addon if you need different menu items for logged in / logged out users.\";i:2370;s:8:\"Standard\";i:2371;s:8:\"Advanced\";i:2372;s:79:\". Extra Field Types are available in <a href=\"%s\">Hobbyist or PRO versions</a>.\";i:2373;s:182:\"Enter a detailed description of the temrs of agreement for the user to read.<br/>Links can be inserted by using standard HTML syntax: &lt;a href=\"custom_url\"&gt;custom_text&lt;/a&gt;\";i:2374;s:142:\"Choose the <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/recaptcha/docs/versions\" target=\"_blank\">type of reCAPTCHA</a> you wish to add to this site.\";i:2375;s:112:\"The site key from Google, <a href=\"http://www.google.com/recaptcha\" target=\"_blank\">www.google.com/recaptcha</a>\";i:2376;s:114:\"The secret key from Google, <a href=\"http://www.google.com/recaptcha\" target=\"_blank\">www.google.com/recaptcha</a>\";i:2377;s:258:\"Enter your Google Maps API key ( <a href=\"https://console.developers.google.com/flows/enableapi?apiid=maps_backend\" target=\"_blank\">Get your API key</a> ). If more than one map fields are added to a form the API key from the first map displayed will be used.\";i:2378;s:13:\"Aruba Guilder\";i:2379;s:100:\"<pre>Title</pre><pre>Type</pre><pre>Meta Name</pre><pre class=\"wppb-mb-head-required\">Required</pre>\";i:2380;s:12:\"More Details\";i:2381;s:192:\"If you enjoy using <strong> %1$s </strong> please <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">rate us on WordPress.org</a>. More happy users means more features, less bugs and better support for everyone. \";i:2382;s:13:\"Contact Forms\";i:2383;s:12:\"Contact Form\";i:2384;s:8:\"Untitled\";i:2385;s:46:\"https://contactform7.com/configuration-errors/\";i:2386;s:32:\"There is a possible empty field.\";i:2387;s:31:\"Invalid mailbox syntax is used.\";i:2388;s:56:\"Sender email address does not belong to the site domain.\";i:2389;s:32:\"HTML tags are used in a message.\";i:2390;s:53:\"Multiple form controls are in a single label element.\";i:2391;s:37:\"There are invalid mail header fields.\";i:2392;s:29:\"Deprecated settings are used.\";i:2393;s:10:\"(required)\";i:2394;s:9:\"Your Name\";i:2395;s:10:\"Your Email\";i:2396;s:7:\"Subject\";i:2397;s:12:\"Your Message\";i:2398;s:4:\"Send\";i:2399;s:8:\"From: %s\";i:2400;s:11:\"Subject: %s\";i:2401;s:13:\"Message Body:\";i:2402;s:55:\"This e-mail was sent from a contact form on %1$s (%2$s)\";i:2403;s:38:\"Sender\'s message was sent successfully\";i:2404;s:45:\"Thank you for your message. It has been sent.\";i:2405;s:31:\"Sender\'s message failed to send\";i:2406;s:71:\"There was an error trying to send your message. Please try again later.\";i:2407;s:26:\"Validation errors occurred\";i:2408;s:61:\"One or more fields have an error. Please check and try again.\";i:2409;s:34:\"Submission was referred to as spam\";i:2410;s:43:\"There are terms that the sender must accept\";i:2411;s:69:\"You must accept the terms and conditions before sending your message.\";i:2412;s:45:\"There is a field that the sender must fill in\";i:2413;s:22:\"The field is required.\";i:2414;s:74:\"There is a field with input that is longer than the maximum allowed length\";i:2415;s:22:\"The field is too long.\";i:2416;s:75:\"There is a field with input that is shorter than the minimum allowed length\";i:2417;s:23:\"The field is too short.\";i:2418;s:51:\"Sender doesn\'t enter the correct answer to the quiz\";i:2419;s:36:\"The answer to the quiz is incorrect.\";i:2420;s:4:\"quiz\";i:2421;s:73:\"Generate a form-tag for a question-answer pair. For more details, see %s.\";i:2422;s:30:\"https://contactform7.com/quiz/\";i:2423;s:4:\"Quiz\";i:2424;s:21:\"Questions and answers\";i:2425;s:83:\"One pipe-separated question-answer pair (e.g. The capital of Brazil?|Rio) per line.\";i:2426;s:12:\"Id attribute\";i:2427;s:15:\"Class attribute\";i:2428;s:10:\"Insert Tag\";i:2429;s:46:\"Date format that the sender entered is invalid\";i:2430;s:29:\"The date format is incorrect.\";i:2431;s:34:\"Date is earlier than minimum limit\";i:2432;s:44:\"The date is before the earliest one allowed.\";i:2433;s:32:\"Date is later than maximum limit\";i:2434;s:41:\"The date is after the latest one allowed.\";i:2435;s:4:\"date\";i:2436;s:69:\"Generate a form-tag for a date input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2437;s:36:\"https://contactform7.com/date-field/\";i:2438;s:10:\"Date Field\";i:2439;s:10:\"Field type\";i:2440;s:14:\"Required field\";i:2441;s:13:\"Default value\";i:2442;s:45:\"Use this text as the placeholder of the field\";i:2443;s:141:\"To use the value input through this field in a mail field, you need to insert the corresponding mail-tag (%s) into the field on the Mail tab.\";i:2444;s:19:\"Invalid key values.\";i:2445;s:15:\"Settings saved.\";i:2446;s:72:\"reCAPTCHA is a free service to protect your website from spam and abuse.\";i:2447;s:10:\"Reset Keys\";i:2448;s:54:\"To use reCAPTCHA, you need to install an API key pair.\";i:2449;s:14:\"Configure Keys\";i:2450;s:25:\"For more details, see %s.\";i:2451;s:35:\"https://contactform7.com/recaptcha/\";i:2452;s:7:\"CAPTCHA\";i:2453;s:86:\"To use reCAPTCHA, first you need to install an API key pair. For more details, see %s.\";i:2454;s:69:\"Generate a form-tag for a reCAPTCHA widget. For more details, see %s.\";i:2455;s:4:\"Size\";i:2456;s:6:\"Normal\";i:2457;s:7:\"Compact\";i:2458;s:5:\"Theme\";i:2459;s:5:\"Light\";i:2460;s:4:\"Dark\";i:2461;s:37:\"Uploading a file fails for any reason\";i:2462;s:46:\"There was an unknown error uploading the file.\";i:2463;s:42:\"Uploaded file is not allowed for file type\";i:2464;s:49:\"You are not allowed to upload files of this type.\";i:2465;s:26:\"Uploaded file is too large\";i:2466;s:20:\"The file is too big.\";i:2467;s:36:\"Uploading a file fails for PHP error\";i:2468;s:38:\"There was an error uploading the file.\";i:2469;s:4:\"file\";i:2470;s:73:\"Generate a form-tag for a file uploading field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2471;s:55:\"https://contactform7.com/file-uploading-and-attachment/\";i:2472;s:29:\"File Uploading and Attachment\";i:2473;s:23:\"File size limit (bytes)\";i:2474;s:21:\"Acceptable file types\";i:2475;s:155:\"To attach the file uploaded through this field to mail, you need to insert the corresponding mail-tag (%s) into the File Attachments field on the Mail tab.\";i:2476;s:189:\"This contact form contains file uploading fields, but the temporary folder for the files (%s) does not exist or is not writable. You can create the folder or change its permission manually.\";i:2477;s:6:\"submit\";i:2478;s:66:\"Generate a form-tag for a submit button. For more details, see %s.\";i:2479;s:39:\"https://contactform7.com/submit-button/\";i:2480;s:13:\"Submit Button\";i:2481;s:9:\"Consented\";i:2482;s:13:\"Not consented\";i:2483;s:10:\"acceptance\";i:2484;s:73:\"Generate a form-tag for an acceptance checkbox. For more details, see %s.\";i:2485;s:45:\"https://contactform7.com/acceptance-checkbox/\";i:2486;s:19:\"Acceptance Checkbox\";i:2487;s:9:\"Condition\";i:2488;s:27:\"Make this checkbox optional\";i:2489;s:45:\"To use CAPTCHA, you need %s plugin installed.\";i:2490;s:55:\"The code that sender entered does not match the CAPTCHA\";i:2491;s:31:\"Your entered code is incorrect.\";i:2492;s:31:\"CAPTCHA (Really Simple CAPTCHA)\";i:2493;s:65:\"To use CAPTCHA, you first need to install and activate %s plugin.\";i:2494;s:104:\"Generate form-tags for a CAPTCHA image and corresponding response input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2495;s:33:\"https://contactform7.com/captcha/\";i:2496;s:14:\"Image settings\";i:2497;s:20:\"Input field settings\";i:2498;s:182:\"This contact form contains CAPTCHA fields, but the temporary folder for the files (%s) does not exist or is not writable. You can create the folder or change its permission manually.\";i:2499;s:122:\"This contact form contains CAPTCHA fields, but the necessary libraries (GD and FreeType) are not available on your server.\";i:2500;s:9:\"text area\";i:2501;s:80:\"Generate a form-tag for a multi-line text input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2502;s:37:\"https://contactform7.com/text-fields/\";i:2503;s:11:\"Text Fields\";i:2504;s:10:\"checkboxes\";i:2505;s:13:\"radio buttons\";i:2506;s:72:\"Generate a form-tag for a group of checkboxes. For more details, see %s.\";i:2507;s:75:\"Generate a form-tag for a group of radio buttons. For more details, see %s.\";i:2508;s:60:\"https://contactform7.com/checkboxes-radio-buttons-and-menus/\";i:2509;s:35:\"Checkboxes, Radio Buttons and Menus\";i:2510;s:20:\"One option per line.\";i:2511;s:34:\"Put a label first, a checkbox last\";i:2512;s:33:\"Wrap each item with label element\";i:2513;s:25:\"Make checkboxes exclusive\";i:2514;s:48:\"Email address that the sender entered is invalid\";i:2515;s:38:\"The e-mail address entered is invalid.\";i:2516;s:38:\"URL that the sender entered is invalid\";i:2517;s:19:\"The URL is invalid.\";i:2518;s:51:\"Telephone number that the sender entered is invalid\";i:2519;s:32:\"The telephone number is invalid.\";i:2520;s:4:\"text\";i:2521;s:3:\"tel\";i:2522;s:87:\"Generate a form-tag for a single-line plain text input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2523;s:90:\"Generate a form-tag for a single-line email address input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2524;s:80:\"Generate a form-tag for a single-line URL input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2525;s:93:\"Generate a form-tag for a single-line telephone number input field. For more details, see %s.\";i:2526;s:7:\"Akismet\";i:2527;s:33:\"This field requires author\'s name\";i:2528;s:42:\"This field requires author\'s email address\";i:2529;s:32:\"This field requires author\'s URL\";i:2530;s:48:\"Number format that the sender entered is invalid\";i:2531;s:29:\"The number format is invalid.\";i:2532;s:36:\"Number is smaller than minimum limit\";i:2533;s:47:\"The number is smaller than the minimum allowed.\";i:2534;s:35:\"Number is larger than maximum limit\";i:2535;s:46:\"The number is larger than the maximum allowed.\";i:2536;s:6:\"number\";i:2537;s:82:\"Generate a form-tag for a field for numeric value input. For more details, see %s.\";i:2538;s:39:\"https://contactform7.com/number-fields/\";i:2539;s:13:\"Number Fields\";i:2540;s:7:\"Spinbox\";i:2541;s:6:\"Slider\";i:2542;s:14:\"drop-down menu\";i:2543;s:67:\"Generate a form-tag for a drop-down menu. For more details, see %s.\";i:2544;s:25:\"Allow multiple selections\";i:2545;s:39:\"Insert a blank item as the first option\";i:2546;s:8:\"Overview\";i:2547;s:17:\"Available Actions\";i:2548;s:9:\"Form-tags\";i:2549;s:9:\"Mail-tags\";i:2550;s:305:\"On this screen, you can manage contact forms provided by Contact Form 7. You can manage an unlimited number of contact forms. Each contact form has a unique ID and Contact Form 7 shortcode ([contact-form-7 ...]). To insert a contact form into a post or a text widget, insert the shortcode into the target.\";i:2551;s:154:\"Hovering over a row in the contact forms list will display action links that allow you to manage your contact form. You can perform the following actions:\";i:2552;s:148:\"<strong>Edit</strong> - Navigates to the editing screen for that contact form. You can also reach that screen by clicking on the contact form title.\";i:2553;s:140:\"<strong>Duplicate</strong> - Clones that contact form. A cloned contact form inherits all content from the original, but has a different ID.\";i:2554;s:101:\"On this screen, you can edit a contact form. A contact form is comprised of the following components:\";i:2555;s:126:\"<strong>Title</strong> is the title of a contact form. This title is only used for labeling a contact form, and can be edited.\";i:2556;s:172:\"<strong>Form</strong> is a content of HTML form. You can use arbitrary HTML, which is allowed inside a form element. You can also use Contact Form 7&#8217;s form-tags here.\";i:2557;s:178:\"<strong>Mail</strong> manages a mail template (headers and message body) that this contact form will send when users submit it. You can use Contact Form 7&#8217;s mail-tags here.\";i:2558;s:168:\"<strong>Mail (2)</strong> is an additional mail template that works similar to Mail. Mail (2) is different in that it is sent only when Mail has been sent successfully.\";i:2559;s:221:\"In <strong>Messages</strong>, you can edit various types of messages used for this contact form. These messages are relatively short messages, like a validation error message you see when you leave a required field blank.\";i:2560;s:136:\"<strong>Additional Settings</strong> provides a place where you can customize the behavior of this contact form by adding code snippets.\";i:2561;s:398:\"A form-tag is a short code enclosed in square brackets used in a form content. A form-tag generally represents an input field, and its components can be separated into four parts: type, name, options, and values. Contact Form 7 supports several types of form-tags including text fields, number fields, date fields, checkboxes, radio buttons, menus, file-uploading fields, CAPTCHAs, and quiz fields.\";i:2562;s:218:\"While form-tags have a comparatively complex syntax, you don&#8217;t need to know the syntax to add form-tags because you can use the straightforward tag generator (<strong>Generate Tag</strong> button on this screen).\";i:2563;s:203:\"A mail-tag is also a short code enclosed in square brackets that you can use in every Mail and Mail (2) field. A mail-tag represents a user input value through an input field of a corresponding form-tag.\";i:2564;s:230:\"There are also special mail-tags that have specific names, but don&#8217;t have corresponding form-tags. They are used to represent meta information of form submissions like the submitter&#8217;s IP address or the URL of the page.\";i:2565;s:160:\"On this screen, you can manage services that are available through Contact Form 7. Using API will allow you to collaborate with any services that are available.\";i:2566;s:183:\"You may need to first sign up for an account with the service that you plan to use. When you do so, you would need to authorize Contact Form 7 to access the service with your account.\";i:2567;s:97:\"Any information you provide will not be shared with service providers without your authorization.\";i:2568;s:21:\"For more information:\";i:2569;s:30:\"https://contactform7.com/docs/\";i:2570;s:29:\"https://contactform7.com/faq/\";i:2571;s:3:\"FAQ\";i:2572;s:33:\"https://contactform7.com/support/\";i:2573;s:7:\"Dismiss\";i:2574;s:37:\"Getting spammed? You have protection.\";i:2575;s:186:\"Spammers target everything; your contact forms aren&#8217;t an exception. Before you get spammed, protect your contact forms with the powerful anti-spam features Contact Form 7 provides.\";i:2576;s:206:\"Contact Form 7 supports spam-filtering with %1$s. Intelligent %2$s blocks annoying spambots. Plus, using %3$s, you can block messages containing specified keywords or those sent from specified IP addresses.\";i:2577;s:53:\"https://contactform7.com/spam-filtering-with-akismet/\";i:2578;s:43:\"https://contactform7.com/comment-blacklist/\";i:2579;s:17:\"comment blacklist\";i:2580;s:34:\"Contact Form 7 needs your support.\";i:2581;s:105:\"It is hard to continue development and support for this plugin without contributions from users like you.\";i:2582;s:73:\"If you enjoy using Contact Form 7 and find it useful, please consider %s.\";i:2583;s:32:\"https://contactform7.com/donate/\";i:2584;s:17:\"making a donation\";i:2585;s:111:\"Your donation will help encourage and support the plugin&#8217;s continued development and better user support.\";i:2586;s:37:\"Before you cry over spilt mail&#8230;\";i:2587;s:190:\"Contact Form 7 doesn&#8217;t store submitted messages anywhere. Therefore, you may lose important messages forever if your mail server has issues or you make a mistake in mail configuration.\";i:2588;s:205:\"Install a message storage plugin before this happens to you. %s saves all messages through contact forms into the database. Flamingo is a free WordPress plugin created by the same author as Contact Form 7.\";i:2589;s:63:\"https://contactform7.com/save-submitted-messages-with-flamingo/\";i:2590;s:8:\"Flamingo\";i:2591;s:47:\"https://contactform7.com/editing-form-template/\";i:2592;s:21:\"Editing Form Template\";i:2593;s:57:\"You can edit the form template here. For details, see %s.\";i:2594;s:4:\"Form\";i:2595;s:8:\"Mail (2)\";i:2596;s:12:\"Use Mail (2)\";i:2597;s:4:\"Mail\";i:2598;s:71:\"Mail (2) is an additional mail template often used as an autoresponder.\";i:2599;s:41:\"https://contactform7.com/setting-up-mail/\";i:2600;s:15:\"Setting Up Mail\";i:2601;s:57:\"You can edit the mail template here. For details, see %s.\";i:2602;s:53:\"In the following fields, you can use these mail-tags:\";i:2603;s:2:\"To\";i:2604;s:4:\"From\";i:2605;s:18:\"Additional Headers\";i:2606;s:12:\"Message Body\";i:2607;s:46:\"Exclude lines with blank mail-tags from output\";i:2608;s:21:\"Use HTML content type\";i:2609;s:16:\"File Attachments\";i:2610;s:42:\"https://contactform7.com/editing-messages/\";i:2611;s:16:\"Editing Messages\";i:2612;s:75:\"You can edit messages used in various situations here. For details, see %s.\";i:2613;s:8:\"Messages\";i:2614;s:45:\"https://contactform7.com/additional-settings/\";i:2615;s:19:\"Additional Settings\";i:2616;s:66:\"You can add customization code snippets here. For details, see %s.\";i:2617;s:20:\"Add New Contact Form\";i:2618;s:17:\"Edit Contact Form\";i:2619;s:16:\"Enter title here\";i:2620;s:78:\"Copy this shortcode and paste it into your post, page, or text widget content:\";i:2621;s:42:\"You can also use this old-style shortcode:\";i:2622;s:79:\"You are about to delete this contact form.\\n  \'Cancel\' to stop, \'OK\' to delete.\";i:2623;s:17:\"Do you need help?\";i:2624;s:60:\"Here are some available options to help solve your problems.\";i:2625;s:15:\"%1$s &#38; %2$s\";i:2626;s:52:\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/contact-form-7/\";i:2627;s:14:\"Support Forums\";i:2628;s:44:\"https://contactform7.com/custom-development/\";i:2629;s:21:\"Professional Services\";i:2630;s:28:\"%1$s %2$s keys switch panels\";i:2631;s:22:\"(left and right arrow)\";i:2632;s:24:\"Additional Settings (%d)\";i:2633;s:14:\"Contact Form 7\";i:2634;s:7:\"Contact\";i:2635;s:31:\"Integration with Other Services\";i:2636;s:11:\"Integration\";i:2637;s:38:\"You are not allowed to edit this item.\";i:2638;s:40:\"You are not allowed to delete this item.\";i:2639;s:18:\"Error in deleting.\";i:2640;s:46:\"You are not allowed to validate configuration.\";i:2641;s:70:\"The changes you made will be lost if you navigate away from this page.\";i:2642;s:15:\"How to resolve?\";i:2643;s:30:\"1 configuration error detected\";i:2644;s:32:\"%d configuration errors detected\";i:2645;s:48:\"1 configuration error detected in this tab panel\";i:2646;s:50:\"%d configuration errors detected in this tab panel\";i:2647;s:21:\"(configuration error)\";i:2648;s:35:\"Search results for &#8220;%s&#8221;\";i:2649;s:20:\"Search Contact Forms\";i:2650;s:22:\"Validate Configuration\";i:2651;s:53:\"https://contactform7.com/configuration-validator-faq/\";i:2652;s:33:\"FAQ about Configuration Validator\";i:2653;s:21:\"Contact form created.\";i:2654;s:19:\"Contact form saved.\";i:2655;s:21:\"Contact form deleted.\";i:2656;s:43:\"There was an error saving the contact form.\";i:2657;s:70:\"Configuration validation completed. No invalid contact form was found.\";i:2658;s:121:\"<strong>Contact Form 7 %1$s requires WordPress %2$s or higher.</strong> Please <a href=\"%3$s\">update WordPress</a> first.\";i:2659;s:46:\"You are not allowed to edit this contact form.\";i:2660;s:37:\"Validate Contact Form 7 Configuration\";i:2661;s:99:\"Misconfiguration leads to mail delivery failure or other troubles. Validate your contact forms now.\";i:2662;s:15:\"Edit Form Types\";i:2663;s:10:\"Form Types\";i:2664;s:8:\"Form key\";i:2665;s:5:\"Trash\";i:2666;s:49:\"cf7-form shortcode key error, unable to find form\";i:2667;s:20:\"Enter your full name\";i:2668;s:19:\"Enter a valid email\";i:2669;s:25:\"the topic of your message\";i:2670;s:21:\"Enter a brief message\";i:2671;s:9:\"Make grid\";i:2672;s:11:\"Insert form\";i:2673;s:21:\"%s keys switch panels\";i:2674;s:14:\"Duplicate Post\";i:2675;s:13:\"for all days!\";i:2676;s:3:\"yes\";i:2677;s:12:\"Booking Form\";i:2678;s:34:\"Select default custom booking form\";i:2679;s:12:\"Custom Forms\";i:2680;s:5:\"Reset\";i:2681;s:28:\"Delete selected booking form\";i:2682;s:19:\"Add New Custom Form\";i:2683;s:29:\"Type the name of booking form\";i:2684;s:6:\"Create\";i:2685;s:15:\"Create new form\";i:2686;s:7:\"Deleted\";i:2687;s:35:\"There are no extended booking forms\";i:2688;s:19:\"Create dates filter\";i:2689;s:30:\"Create conditional days filter\";i:2690;s:18:\"Set Valuation Days\";i:2691;s:13:\"Nothing Found\";i:2692;s:5:\"Error\";i:2693;s:8:\"Resource\";i:2694;s:19:\"Hide season filters\";i:2695;s:29:\"Show all exist season filters\";i:2696;s:4:\"days\";i:2697;s:5:\"Costs\";i:2698;s:6:\"Season\";i:2699;s:7:\"Actions\";i:2700;s:12:\"Add new cost\";i:2701;s:7:\"Example\";i:2702;s:8:\"Warning!\";i:2703;s:14:\" for all days!\";i:2704;s:23:\"from the cost of 1 day \";i:2705;s:9:\"per 1 day\";i:2706;s:3:\"day\";i:2707;s:3:\"For\";i:2708;s:8:\"Together\";i:2709;s:2:\"to\";i:2710;s:31:\"Additional cost in %s per 1 day\";i:2711;s:8:\"Any days\";i:2712;s:13:\"Advanced Cost\";i:2713;s:63:\"Customization of additional cost, which depend from form fields\";i:2714;s:22:\"Advanced Cost Settings\";i:2715;s:11:\"Form fields\";i:2716;s:25:\"Content of Booking Fields\";i:2717;s:5:\"Note!\";i:2718;s:89:\"Configure additional cost, which depend from selection of selectbox(es) and checkbox(es).\";i:2719;s:111:\"Fields %s(selectbox(es) and checkbox(es))%s are shown here automatically if they exist in the %sbooking form%s.\";i:2720;s:12:\"Deposit type\";i:2721;s:13:\"of total cost\";i:2722;s:5:\"night\";i:2723;s:17:\"as additional sum\";i:2724;s:33:\"Enter additional cost in formats:\";i:2725;s:16:\"Enter fixed cost\";i:2726;s:38:\"Enter percentage of the entire booking\";i:2727;s:40:\"Enter fixed amount for each selected day\";i:2728;s:89:\"Enter percentage as additional sum, which is based only on original cost and not full sum\";i:2729;s:112:\"Use arithmetic expressions in cost configurations, including fields shortcodes and simple mathematics operations\";i:2730;s:31:\"Limit available days from today\";i:2731;s:61:\"Select number of available days in calendar start from today.\";i:2732;s:39:\"Unavailable time before / after booking\";i:2733;s:10:\"Important!\";i:2734;s:108:\"This feature is applying only for bookings for specific timeslots, or if activated check in/out time option.\";i:2735;s:7:\"minutes\";i:2736;s:4:\"hour\";i:2737;s:5:\"hours\";i:2738;s:14:\"Before booking\";i:2739;s:33:\"Select unavailable time interval.\";i:2740;s:13:\"After booking\";i:2741;s:6:\"day(s)\";i:2742;s:25:\"Showing cost in date cell\";i:2743;s:15:\"Currency symbol\";i:2744;s:6:\"Custom\";i:2745;s:23:\"Showing cost in tooltip\";i:2746;s:108:\" Check this box to display the daily cost with a tooltip when mouse hovers over each day on the calendar(s).\";i:2747;s:10:\"Cost Title\";i:2748;s:6:\"Cost: \";i:2749;s:31:\"Show booking details in tooltip\";i:2750;s:15:\"Booking details\";i:2751;s:48:\"This option can impact to speed of page loading.\";i:2752;s:12:\"Default Form\";i:2753;s:12:\"Availability\";i:2754;s:51:\"Configuration of availability for booking resources\";i:2755;s:21:\"Availability Settings\";i:2756;s:15:\"Google Calendar\";i:2757;s:13:\"Events Import\";i:2758;s:53:\"Customization of synchronization with Google Calendar\";i:2759;s:23:\"Show Children Resources\";i:2760;s:23:\"Hide Children Resources\";i:2761;s: