art day of range\";i:3167;s:48:\"Select your start day of range selection at week\";i:3168;s:24:\"Specific days selections\";i:3169;s:255:\"Type your %sspecific%s days, which can be selected by visitors, or leave this value empty. It can be several days separated by comma (example: %s) or by dash (example: %s, its the same like this: %s) or combination (example:%s, its the same like this: %s)\";i:3170;s:43:\"Use time selections as recurrent time slots\";i:3171;s:269:\"Check this box if you want to use recurrent time to reserve several days. This means that middle days will be partially booked by actual times, otherwise the time in the booking form will be used as check-in/check-out time for the first and last day of the reservation.\";i:3172;s:31:\"Set check out date as available\";i:3173;s:68:\"Check this option, to remove last selected day of saving to booking.\";i:3174;s:21:\"Use check in/out time\";i:3175;s:68:\"Check this option, to use check in/out time during booking process. \";i:3176;s:13:\"Check-in time\";i:3177;s:14:\"Check-Out time\";i:3178;s:29:\"Change over days as triangles\";i:3179;s:58:\"Check this option, to show change over days as triangles. \";i:3180;s:13:\"Booked Times:\";i:3181;s:27:\"Title of booked timeslot(s)\";i:3182;s:29:\"Auto approve all new bookings\";i:3183;s:35:\"Auto approve bookings during import\";i:3184;s:45:\"Auto approve booking, if booking cost is zero\";i:3185;s:59:\"Auto approve bookings after creation booking in admin panel\";i:3186;s:20:\"Auto-cancel bookings\";i:3187;s:74:\"Cancel only pending, unpaid bookings, which are older than this selection.\";i:3188;s:23:\"Cancellation email sent\";i:3189;s:23:\"Reason for cancellation\";i:3190;s:11:\"Resource #1\";i:3191;s:11:\"Resource #2\";i:3192;s:11:\"Resource #3\";i:3193;s:23:\"Cost saved successfully\";i:3194;s:46:\"Cost is not correct. It must be greater than 0\";i:3195;s:21:\"Request has been sent\";i:3196;s:18:\"Request has failed\";i:3197;s:42:\"The payment status is changed successfully\";i:3198;s:40:\"The changing of payment status is failed\";i:3199;s:7:\"deposit\";i:3200;s:10:\"Total cost\";i:3201;s:7:\"balance\";i:3202;s:27:\"Enable this payment gateway\";i:3203;s:12:\"API Login ID\";i:3204;s:69:\"The merchant API Login ID is provided in the Merchant Interface of %s\";i:3205;s:15:\"Transaction Key\";i:3206;s:44:\"This parameter have to assigned to you by %s\";i:3207;s:18:\"Chose payment mode\";i:3208;s:5:\"Note:\";i:3209;s:14:\"Developer Test\";i:3210;s:9:\"Live Test\";i:3211;s:4:\"Live\";i:3212;s:16:\"Transaction type\";i:3213;s:64:\"Select transaction type, which supported by the payment gateway.\";i:3214;s:25:\"Authorization and Capture\";i:3215;s:18:\"Authorization Only\";i:3216;s:12:\"U.S. Dollars\";i:3217;s:15:\"Pounds Sterling\";i:3218;s:5:\"Euros\";i:3219;s:16:\"Canadian Dollars\";i:3220;s:17:\"Accepted Currency\";i:3221;s:59:\"The currency code that gateway will process the payment in.\";i:3222;s:92:\"Setting the currency that is not supported by the payment processor will result in an error.\";i:3223;s:7:\"Pay via\";i:3224;s:20:\"Payment button title\";i:3225;s:37:\"Enter the title of the payment button\";i:3226;s:38:\"Payment description at gateway website\";i:3227;s:87:\"You can use any shortcodes, which you have used in content of booking fields data form.\";i:3228;s:62:\"This field support only up to %s characters by payment system.\";i:3229;s:23:\"Activate Relay Response\";i:3230;s:101:\"Indicate to the payment gateway that you would like to receive the transaction response to your site.\";i:3231;s:137:\"You should leave empty the Relay Response URL and Receipt Link URL/Text in the Merchant Interface, if a Relay Response is activated here.\";i:3232;s:14:\"MD5 Hash value\";i:3233;s:67:\"To configure MD5 Hash value in Relay Response for your transactions\";i:3234;s:32:\"Log on to the Merchant Interface\";i:3235;s:57:\"Click Settings under Account in the main menu on the left\";i:3236;s:47:\"Click MD5-Hash in the Security Settings section\";i:3237;s:16:\"Enter this value\";i:3238;s:12:\"Click Submit\";i:3239;s:126:\"For more information about configuring Relay Response in the Merchant Interface, please see the %sMerchant Integration Guide%s\";i:3240;s:33:\"Return URL after Successful order\";i:3241;s:66:\"The URL where visitor will be redirected after completing payment.\";i:3242;s:80:\"For example, a URL to your site that displays a %s\"Thank you for the payment\"%s.\";i:3243;s:29:\"Return URL after Failed order\";i:3244;s:70:\"The URL where the visitor will be redirected after completing payment.\";i:3245;s:81:\"For example, the URL to your website that displays a %s\"Payment Canceled\"%s page.\";i:3246;s:29:\"Automatically approve booking\";i:3247;s:89:\"Check this box to automatically approve booking, when visitor makes a successful payment.\";i:3248;s:7:\"Warning\";i:3249;s:59:\"This will not work, if the visitor leaves the payment page.\";i:3250;s:11:\"%s Settings\";i:3251;s:42:\"Integration of authorizenet payment system\";i:3252;s:195:\"If you have no account on this system, please sign up for a %sdeveloper test account%s to obtain an API Login ID and Transaction Key. These keys will authenticate requests to the payment gateway.\";i:3253;s:99:\"Please configure all fields inside the %sBilling form fields%s section at %sPayments General%s tab.\";i:3254;s:36:\"%s - Server Integration Method (SIM)\";i:3255;s:42:\"Payment for booking %s on these day(s): %s\";i:3256;s:13:\"Merchant Code\";i:3257;s:32:\"Enter your iPay88 Merchant Code.\";i:3258;s:12:\"Merchant Key\";i:3259;s:31:\"Enter your iPay88 Merchant Key.\";i:3260;s:17:\"Malaysian Ringgit\";i:3261;s:16:\"Philippine Pesos\";i:3262;s:36:\"Automatically approve/cancel booking\";i:3263;s:170:\"Check this box to automatically approve bookings, when visitor makes a successful payment, or automatically cancel the booking, when visitor makes a payment cancellation.\";i:3264;s:18:\"Successful payment\";i:3265;s:26:\" Parameters are incorrect,\";i:3266;s:22:\"Cannot find the record\";i:3267;s:16:\"Amount different\";i:3268;s:14:\"Payment failed\";i:3269;s:46:\"Payment status updated by Mobile88 Admin(Fail)\";i:3270;s:16:\"Connection Error\";i:3271;s:36:\"Integration of iPay88 payment system\";i:3272;s:16:\"Payment rejected\";i:3273;s:13:\"Please pay %s\";i:3274;s:21:\"Chose payment account\";i:3275;s:4:\"TEST\";i:3276;s:4:\"LIVE\";i:3277;s:15:\"Publishable key\";i:3278;s:10:\"Secret key\";i:3279;s:32:\"Integration of %s payment system\";i:3280;s:32:\"require PHP version %s or newer!\";i:3281;s:69:\"If you have no account on this system, please visit %s to create one.\";i:3282;s:28:\"Pay using %s payment service\";i:3283;s:11:\"Vendor Name\";i:3284;s:89:\"Set this value to the Vendor Name assigned to you by Sage Pay or chosen when you applied.\";i:3285;s:23:\"XOR Encryption password\";i:3286;s:73:\"Set this value to the XOR Encryption password assigned to you by Sage Pay\";i:3287;s:64:\"Select TEST for the Test Server and LIVE in the live environment\";i:3288;s:9:\"SIMULATOR\";i:3289;s:91:\"This can be DEFERRED or AUTHENTICATED if your Sage Pay account supports those payment types\";i:3290;s:7:\"PAYMENT\";i:3291;s:8:\"DEFERRED\";i:3292;s:12:\"AUTHENTICATE\";i:3293;s:3:\"Yen\";i:3294;s:18:\"Australian Dollars\";i:3295;s:11:\"Swiss Franc\";i:3296;s:13:\"Swedish Krona\";i:3297;s:12:\"Danish Krone\";i:3298;s:12:\"Polish Zloty\";i:3299;s:15:\"Norwegian Krone\";i:3300;s:16:\"Hungarian Forint\";i:3301;s:12:\"Czech Koruna\";i:3302;s:14:\"Israeli Shekel\";i:3303;s:12:\"Mexican Peso\";i:3304;s:41:\"Brazilian Real (only for Brazilian users)\";i:3305;s:45:\"Malaysian Ringgits (only for Malaysian users)\";i:3306;s:18:\"Taiwan New Dollars\";i:3307;s:9:\"Thai Baht\";i:3308;s:4:\"Sage\";i:3309;s:34:\"Integration of Sage payment system\";i:3310;s:75:\"Payment method description that the customer will see on your payment page.\";i:3311;s:13:\"Bank Transfer\";i:3312;s:43:\"Integration of Bank Transfer payment system\";i:3313;s:15:\"Account details\";i:3314;s:49:\"Allow payments by %sdirect bank / wire transfer%s\";i:3315;s:36:\"Its only show fixed payment details.\";i:3316;s:9:\"Sort Code\";i:3317;s:148:\"Dear %sMake your payment %s directly into our bank account. %sPlease use your Booking ID %s as the payment reference! %s %s: %s %s: %s %s: %s %s: %s\";i:3318;s:14:\"Account Number\";i:3319;s:4:\"IBAN\";i:3320;s:11:\"BIC / Swift\";i:3321;s:12:\"Account Name\";i:3322;s:9:\"Bank Name\";i:3323;s:3:\"BSB\";i:3324;s:19:\"Bank Transit Number\";i:3325;s:4:\"IFSC\";i:3326;s:11:\"Branch Sort\";i:3327;s:9:\"Bank Code\";i:3328;s:14:\"Routing Number\";i:3329;s:11:\"Branch Code\";i:3330;s:60:\"You can use following shortcodes in content of this template\";i:3331;s:40:\"%s - inserting all bank accounts details\";i:3332;s:27:\"%s - inserting account name\";i:3333;s:29:\"%s - inserting account number\";i:3334;s:25:\"%s - inserting bank name \";i:3335;s:25:\"%s - inserting sort code \";i:3336;s:20:\"%s - inserting IBAN \";i:3337;s:19:\"%s - inserting BIC \";i:3338;s:36:\"%s - inserting the cost of  booking \";i:3339;s:105:\"You can use any shortcodes, that you can use in payment description form at Settings Payment General page\";i:3340;s:13:\"+ Add Account\";i:3341;s:26:\"Remove selected account(s)\";i:3342;s:9:\"for 1 day\";i:3343;s:11:\"for 1 night\";i:3344;s:9:\"fixed sum\";i:3345;s:10:\"for 1 hour\";i:3346;s:12:\"Set the cost\";i:3347;s:32:\" Select your cost configuration.\";i:3348;s:19:\"Time impact to cost\";i:3349;s:182:\"Check this box if you want that specific additional cost, which configured as percentage for some option, apply to other additional fixed costs and not only to original booking cost.\";i:3350;s:51:\"Do not show payment form, after submit booking form\";i:3351;s:63:\"Auto send payment request after creation booking in admin panel\";i:3352;s:44:\"Show deposit and total booking cost together\";i:3353;s:98:\"Check this box if you want to show deposit amount and total booking cost, after submit of booking.\";i:3354;s:9:\"Important\";i:3355;s:192:\"Please note, at admin panel for booking will be saved deposit cost and notes about deposit, do not depend from the visitor choice of this payment. You need to check each such payment manually!\";i:3356;s:26:\"Send email on cost changes\";i:3357;s:117:\"Check this box if you want to send booking modification email, if cost of booking was edited in booking listing page.\";i:3358;s:8:\"Currency\";i:3359;s:117:\"This is default currency that showing at your website. Specific payment gateway(s) can support or does not suport it.\";i:3360;s:63:\"Check and configure currency at each activated payment gateway.\";i:3361;s:17:\"Currency Position\";i:3362;s:36:\"Set position of the currency symbol.\";i:3363;s:4:\"Left\";i:3364;s:5:\"Right\";i:3365;s:15:\"Left with space\";i:3366;s:16:\"Right with space\";i:3367;s:24:\"Number of decimal points\";i:3368;s:12:\"No separator\";i:3369;s:5:\"Space\";i:3370;s:3:\"Dot\";i:3371;s:5:\"Comma\";i:3372;s:31:\"Separator for the decimal point\";i:3373;s:19:\"Thousands separator\";i:3374;s:13:\"Please select\";i:3375;s:129:\"Please select a field from your booking form. This field will be automatically assigned to the current field in the billing form.\";i:3376;s:14:\"Customer Email\";i:3377;s:13:\"First Name(s)\";i:3378;s:9:\"Last name\";i:3379;s:12:\"Billing City\";i:3380;s:9:\"Post Code\";i:3381;s:5:\"State\";i:3382;s:36:\"Show booking details in payment form\";i:3383;s:56:\"Configure booking details summary above the payment form\";i:3384;s:8:\"Payments\";i:3385;s:23:\"Customizaton of Payment\";i:3386;s:16:\"Payment Gateways\";i:3387;s:7:\"General\";i:3388;s:16:\"Payment Settings\";i:3389;s:35:\"Payment Gateways - General Settings\";i:3390;s:23:\"Active Payment Gateways\";i:3391;s:19:\"Billing form fields\";i:3392;s:15:\"Payment Options\";i:3393;s:19:\"Payment Description\";i:3394;s:11:\"Pay in Cash\";i:3395;s:7:\"Gateway\";i:3396;s:71:\"Some currencies at payment gateways are different from main currency %s\";i:3397;s:164:\"Interface of plugin is using %s currency. Specific payment gateway will use own currency in payment form without currency exchange! Its can be reason of wrong cost.\";i:3398;s:40:\"Use these shortcodes for customization: \";i:3399;s:13:\"ID of booking\";i:3400;s:23:\"ID of booking resources\";i:3401;s:11:\"website URL\";i:3402;s:10:\"IP of user\";i:3403;s:26:\"browser user agent of user\";i:3404;s:11:\"request URL\";i:3405;s:12:\"current date\";i:3406;s:12:\"current time\";i:3407;s:26:\"URL to manage this booking\";i:3408;s:24:\"URL to edit this booking\";i:3409;s:26:\"URL to cancel this booking\";i:3410;s:33:\"URL of payment request of booking\";i:3411;s:20:\"HASH of this booking\";i:3412;s:28:\"content data of this booking\";i:3413;s:18:\"show amount to pay\";i:3414;s:18:\"total booking cost\";i:3415;s:12:\"deposit cost\";i:3416;s:12:\"balance cost\";i:3417;s:21:\"original booking cost\";i:3418;s:23:\"additional booking cost\";i:3419;s:11:\"Merchant ID\";i:3420;s:28:\"Enter your iDEAL Merchant ID\";i:3421;s:30:\"Enter your iDEAL Merchant Key.\";i:3422;s:90:\"Test mode requires the option %s to be selected in the %s account configuration section %s\";i:3423;s:19:\"Test with Simulator\";i:3424;s:25:\"My Profile – Connection\";i:3425;s:197:\"If not supplied then the description as configured in the administration/management portal section will be used. If the option %s is selected then the configured description will always be applied.\";i:3426;s:22:\"Always use Description\";i:3427;s:38:\"Processing your %s payments through %s\";i:3428;s:41:\"Integration of Pay in Cash payment system\";i:3429;s:67:\"If you accept %scash payment%s, you can write details about it here\";i:3430;s:89:\"Dear %sPay in cash %s for your booking %s on check in %sFor reference your booking ID: %s\";i:3431;s:54:\"Make payments with payPal - its fast, free and secure!\";i:3432;s:15:\"Paypal Standard\";i:3433;s:26:\"Paypal Pro Hosted Solution\";i:3434;s:12:\"Account Type\";i:3435;s:40:\"Paypal Email address to receive payments\";i:3436;s:18:\"Secure Merchant ID\";i:3437;s:122:\" Indicates whether the transaction is payment on a final sale or an authorization for a final sale, to be captured later. \";i:3438;s:4:\"Sale\";i:3439;s:13:\"Authorization\";i:3440;s:69:\" Select using test (Sandbox Test Environment) or live PayPal payment.\";i:3441;s:86:\"PayPal sandbox can be used to test payments. Sign up for a developer account %shere%s.\";i:3442;s:7:\"Sandbox\";i:3443;s:13:\"British Pound\";i:3444;s:12:\"Japanese Yen\";i:3445;s:18:\"Israeli New Shekel\";i:3446;s:39:\"Turkish Lira (only for Turkish members)\";i:3447;s:19:\"Custom button title\";i:3448;s:19:\"Payment Button type\";i:3449;s:24:\"Show Payment description\";i:3450;s:58:\"Check this box to show payment description in payment form\";i:3451;s:23:\"Show Reference Text Box\";i:3452;s:41:\"Check this box to show Reference Text Box\";i:3453;s:23:\"Enter your phone number\";i:3454;s:24:\"Reference Text Box Title\";i:3455;s:96:\"Enter a title for the Reference text box (i.e. Your email address). Visitors will see this text.\";i:3456;s:22:\"Return URL from PayPal\";i:3457;s:29:\"Cancel Return URL from PayPal\";i:3458;s:35:\"Follow these steps to configure it:\";i:3459;s:30:\"Log in to your PayPal account.\";i:3460;s:25:\"Click the Profile subtab.\";i:3461;s:67:\"Click Website Payment Preferences in the Seller Preferences column.\";i:3462;s:66:\"Under Auto Return for Website Payments, click the On radio button.\";i:3463;s:90:\"For the Return URL, enter the Return URL from PayPal on your site for successfull payment.\";i:3464;s:114:\"Instant Payment Notification (IPN) is a message service that notifies you of events related to PayPal transactions\";i:3465;s:38:\"Sending email for verified transaction\";i:3466;s:37:\"Sending email for invalid transaction\";i:3467;s:48:\"Sending email if error occur during verification\";i:3468;s:18:\"Use SSL connection\";i:3469;s:76:\"Use the SSL connection for posting data, instead of standard HTTP connection\";i:3470;s:16:\"Use cURL posting\";i:3471;s:62:\"Use the cURL for posting data, instead of fsockopen() function\";i:3472;s:74:\" Follow these instructions to set up your listener at your PayPal account:\";i:3473;s:36:\"Click Profile on the My Account tab.\";i:3474;s:81:\"Click Instant Payment Notification Preferences in the Selling Preferences column.\";i:3475;s:82:\"Click Choose IPN Settings to specify your listeners URL and activate the listener.\";i:3476;s:67:\"Specify the URL for your listener in the Notification URL field as:\";i:3477;s:61:\"Click Receive IPN messages (Enabled) to enable your listener.\";i:3478;s:11:\"Click Save.\";i:3479;s:86:\"Click Back to Profile Summary to return to the Profile after activating your listener.\";i:3480;s:6:\"PayPal\";i:3481;s:36:\"Integration of Paypal payment system\";i:3482;s:10:\"PayPal IPN\";i:3483;s:9:\"Error IPN\";i:3484;s:12:\"Verified IPN\";i:3485;s:11:\"Invalid IPN\";i:3486;s:14:\"Search results\";i:3487;s:8:\"Book now\";i:3488;s:19:\"Search availability\";i:3489;s:15:\"Search results.\";i:3490;s:14:\"Nothing found.\";i:3491;s:15:\"Result(s) Found\";i:3492;s:22:\"Title of search widget\";i:3493;s:23:\"Title of search results\";i:3494;s:21:\"Nothing found message\";i:3495;s:21:\"URL of Search Results\";i:3496;s:6:\"coupon\";i:3497;s:8:\"discount\";i:3498;s:8:\"Superior\";i:3499;s:18:\"Presidential Suite\";i:3500;s:7:\"Coupons\";i:3501;s:28:\"Setting coupons for discount\";i:3502;s:23:\"Add New Discount Coupon\";i:3503;s:11:\"Coupon Code\";i:3504;s:7:\"Savings\";i:3505;s:12:\"Minimum Cost\";i:3506;s:10:\"Expiration\";i:3507;s:4:\"Year\";i:3508;s:5:\"Month\";i:3509;s:3:\"Day\";i:3510;s:15:\"Number of usage\";i:3511;s:18:\"Enter coupon code.\";i:3512;s:44:\"Enter number of fixed or percentage savings.\";i:3513;s:15:\"Expiration Date\";i:3514;s:37:\"Select Expiration Date of the coupon.\";i:3515;s:20:\"Minimum Booking Cost\";i:3516;s:54:\"Enter minimum booking cost, when coupon is applicable.\";i:3517;s:23:\"Maximum number of usage\";i:3518;s:57:\"Enter maximum number of times, when coupon is applicable.\";i:3519;s:70:\"Select booking resources, where is possible to apply this coupon code.\";i:3520;s:50:\"Example: %s - custom number of visitor selections\"\";i:3521;s:22:\"HTML tags is accepted.\";i:3522;s:7:\"hour(s)\";i:3523;s:16:\"Cache expiration\";i:3524;s:31:\"Select time of cache expiration\";i:3525;s:13:\"Cache Updated\";i:3526;s:24:\"Search Availability Form\";i:3527;s:14:\"Search Results\";i:3528;s:12:\"Search Cache\";i:3529;s:77:\"CSS customization of search form and search results you can make at this file\";i:3530;s:15:\"Select Template\";i:3531;s:27:\"Inline Search Form Template\";i:3532;s:31:\"Horizontal Search Form Template\";i:3533;s:29:\"Standard Search Form Template\";i:3534;s:30:\"Reset Search Availability Form\";i:3535;s:49:\"Found: %s booking forms inside of posts or pages \";i:3536;s:18:\"Reset Search Cache\";i:3537;s:113:\"Use \"Check In\" date as available in calendar for booking resources with capacity higher then 1 for search results\";i:3538;s:110:\"Use \"Check Out\" date as available in calendar for booking resources with capacity higher then 1 search results\";i:3539;s:28:\"Show availability in tooltip\";i:3540;s:135:\"Check this box to display the available number of booking resources with a tooltip, when mouse hovers over each day on the calendar(s).\";i:3541;s:11:\"Available: \";i:3542;s:18:\"Availability Title\";i:3543;s:29:\"Use pending days as available\";i:3544;s:104:\"Auto Cancel all pending bookings for the specific date(s), if some booking is approved for these date(s)\";i:3545;s:40:\"Set capacity based on number of visitors\";i:3546;s:68:\"Please read more info about configuration of this parameter %shere%s\";i:3547;s:127:\"Add tooltip on calendar(s) to show availability based on the number of available booking resource items remaining for each day.\";i:3548;s:139:\"Be sure to match the maximum number of visitors for the %sone booking resource%s with the number of visitors specified on the booking form.\";i:3549;s:156:\"Display tooltip on calendar(s) to show availability based on total (fixed) number of visitors for the resource, which can be at free booking resource items.\";i:3550;s:136:\"Be sure to match the maximum number of visitors for %sall booking resources%s with the number of visitors specified on the booking form.\";i:3551;s:47:\"Disable bookings in different booking resources\";i:3552;s:92:\"Check this box to dissable reservations, which can be stored in different booking resources.\";i:3553;s:99:\"When checked, all reserved days must be at same booking resource otherwise error message will show.\";i:3554;s:12:\"Max visitors\";i:3555;s:13:\"Form Settings\";i:3556;s:30:\"Customization of Form Settings\";i:3557;s:14:\"Delete booking\";i:3558;s:8:\"Actions:\";i:3559;s:15:\"Min / Max cost:\";i:3560;s:21:\"Reason of Cancelation\";i:3561;s:8:\"Max Cost\";i:3562;s:3:\"Any\";i:3563;s:8:\"Specific\";i:3564;s:12:\"General Info\";i:3565;s:15:\"Standard Fields\";i:3566;s:15:\"Advanced Fields\";i:3567;s:11:\"Bla bla bla\";i:3568;s:14:\"Section Header\";i:3569;s:8:\"Bookings\";i:3570;s:4:\"week\";i:3571;s:5:\"weeks\";i:3572;s:5:\"month\";i:3573;s:6:\"months\";i:3574;s:32:\"Filter bookings by booking dates\";i:3575;s:13:\"Current dates\";i:3576;s:5:\"Today\";i:3577;s:14:\"Previous dates\";i:3578;s:9:\"All dates\";i:3579;s:18:\"Today check in/out\";i:3580;s:19:\"Check In - Tomorrow\";i:3581;s:20:\"Check Out - Tomorrow\";i:3582;s:5:\"Prior\";i:3583;s:8:\"Check-in\";i:3584;s:9:\"Check-out\";i:3585;s:4:\"Tada\";i:3586;s:9:\"Help info\";i:3587;s:12:\"About Plugin\";i:3588;s:17:\"Technical Support\";i:3589;s:17:\"Calendar Overview\";i:3590;s:172:\"Probably you updated your paid version of Booking Calendar by free version or update process failed. You can request the new update of your paid version at %1sthis page%2s.\";i:3591;s:30:\"Don\'t show the message anymore\";i:3592;s:222:\".ics - is a file format of iCalendar standard for exchanging calendar and scheduling information between different sources %s Using a common calendar format (.ics), you can keep all your calendars updated and synchronized.\";i:3593;s:44:\"and any other calendar that uses .ics format\";i:3594;s:13:\"Calendar Skin\";i:3595;s:39:\"Select the skin of the booking calendar\";i:3596;s:8:\"month(s)\";i:3597;s:7:\"year(s)\";i:3598;s:16:\"Number of months\";i:3599;s:52:\"Select the maximum number of months to show (scroll)\";i:3600;s:21:\"Start Day of the week\";i:3601;s:33:\"Select your start day of the week\";i:3602;s:21:\"Unavailable week days\";i:3603;s:83:\"Check unavailable days in calendars. This option will overwrite all other settings.\";i:3604;s:27:\"Unavailable days from today\";i:3605;s:63:\"Select number of unavailable days in calendar start from today.\";i:3606;s:6:\"Simple\";i:3607;s:117:\"Check the box, if you want to use simple booking form customization from Free plugin version at Settings - Form page.\";i:3608;s:58:\"Check the box to activate CAPTCHA inside the booking form.\";i:3609;s:16:\"Auto-fill fields\";i:3610;s:68:\"Check the box to activate auto-fill form fields for logged in users.\";i:3611;s:17:\"Use CSS BootStrap\";i:3612;s:39:\"Using BootStrap CSS for the form fields\";i:3613;s:86:\"You must not deactivate loading BootStrap files at advanced section of these settings!\";i:3614;s:26:\"Show legend below calendar\";i:3615;s:71:\"Check this box to display a legend of dates below the booking calendar.\";i:3616;s:14:\"Available item\";i:3617;s:9:\"Available\";i:3618;s:60:\"Activate and type your %stitle of available%s item in legend\";i:3619;s:12:\"Pending item\";i:3620;s:58:\"Activate and type your %stitle of pending%s item in legend\";i:3621;s:13:\"Approved item\";i:3622;s:6:\"Booked\";i:3623;s:59:\"Activate and type your %stitle of approved%s item in legend\";i:3624;s:21:\"Partially booked item\";i:3625;s:16:\"Partially booked\";i:3626;s:67:\"Activate and type your %stitle of partially booked%s item in legend\";i:3627;s:75:\"Partially booked item - day, which is booked for the specific time-slot(s).\";i:3628;s:26:\"Show date number in legend\";i:3629;s:61:\"Check this box to display today date number in legend cells. \";i:3630;s:24:\"Show \"Thank You\" message\";i:3631;s:42:\"Redirect visitor to a new \"Thank You\" page\";i:3632;s:66:\"This action will have no effect, if the payment form(s) is active!\";i:3633;s:28:\"Action after booking is done\";i:3634;s:100:\"Thank you for your online booking. %s We will send confirmation of your booking as soon as possible.\";i:3635;s:13:\"Message title\";i:3636;s:56:\"Type title of message %safter booking has done by user%s\";i:3637;s:23:\"Time of message showing\";i:3638;s:56:\"Set duration of time (milliseconds) to show this message\";i:3639;s:23:\"URL of \"thank you\" page\";i:3640;s:32:\"Type URL of %s\"Thank You\" page%s\";i:3641;s:16:\"Bookings Listing\";i:3642;s:26:\"Default booking admin page\";i:3643;s:69:\"Select your default view mode of bookings at the booking listing page\";i:3644;s:4:\"Week\";i:3645;s:8:\"2 Months\";i:3646;s:8:\"3 Months\";i:3647;s:26:\"Default calendar view mode\";i:3648;s:72:\"Select your default calendar view mode at booking calendar overview page\";i:3649;s:10:\"Filter tab\";i:3650;s:11:\"Actions tab\";i:3651;s:19:\"Default toolbar tab\";i:3652;s:65:\"Select your default opened tab in toolbar at booking listing page\";i:3653;s:24:\"Bookings number per page\";i:3654;s:53:\"Select number of bookings per page in booking listing\";i:3655;s:3:\"ASC\";i:3656;s:4:\"DESC\";i:3657;s:22:\"Bookings default order\";i:3658;s:60:\"Select your default order of bookings in the booking listing\";i:3659;s:11:\"Date Format\";i:3660;s:6:\"F j, Y\";i:3661;s:92:\"Type your date format for emails and the booking table. %sDocumentation on date formatting%s\";i:3662;s:15:\"Short days view\";i:3663;s:14:\"Wide days view\";i:3664;s:10:\"Dates view\";i:3665;s:55:\"Select the default view for dates on the booking tables\";i:3666;s:17:\"Show / hide hints\";i:3667;s:65:\"Check this box if you want to show help hints on the admin panel.\";i:3668;s:40:\"Allow unlimited bookings per same day(s)\";i:3669;s:213:\"Check this box, if you want to %sset any days as available%s in calendar. Your visitors will be able to make %sunlimited bookings per same date(s) in calendar and do not see any booked date(s)%s of other visitors.\";i:3670;s:61:\"Checking to prevent double booking, during submitting booking\";i:3671;s:102:\"Check this box, if you want to %sre-check if the selected dates available during submitting booking%s.\";i:3672;s:165:\"This feature useful to prevent double booking of the same date(s) or time(s), if several visitors try to book the same date(s) in same calendar during the same time.\";i:3673;s:79:\"This feature does not work for booking resources with capacity higher than one.\";i:3674;s:44:\"Show advanced settings of JavaScript loading\";i:3675;s:44:\"Hide advanced settings of JavaScript loading\";i:3676;s:38:\"Disable Bootstrap loading on Front-End\";i:3677;s:126:\" If your theme or some other plugin is load the BootStrap JavaScripts, you can disable  loading of this script by this plugin.\";i:3678;s:37:\"Disable Bootstrap loading on Back-End\";i:3679;s:44:\"Load JS and CSS files only on specific pages\";i:3680;s:78:\"Activate loading of CSS and JavaScript files of plugin only at specific pages.\";i:3681;s:61:\"Relative URLs of pages, where to load plugin CSS and JS files\";i:3682;s:156:\"Enter relative URLs of pages, where you have Booking Calendar elements (booking forms or availability calendars). Please enter one URL per line. Example: %s\";i:3683;s:43:\"Show system debugging log for beta features\";i:3684;s:51:\"Activate this option only for testing beta features\";i:3685;s:34:\"Show settings of powered by notice\";i:3686;s:34:\"Hide settings of powered by notice\";i:3687;s:17:\"Powered by notice\";i:3688;s:69:\" Turn On/Off powered by \"Booking Calendar\" notice under the calendar.\";i:3689;s:21:\"Help and info notices\";i:3690;s:71:\" Turn On/Off version notice and help info links at booking admin panel.\";i:3691;s:20:\"Plugin menu position\";i:3692;s:3:\"Top\";i:3693;s:6:\"Middle\";i:3694;s:6:\"Bottom\";i:3695;s:38:\"User permissions for plugin menu pages\";i:3696;s:11:\"Add booking\";i:3697;s:53:\"Select user access level for the menu pages of plugin\";i:3698;s:7:\"Premium\";i:3699;s:16:\"Show / hide menu\";i:3700;s:44:\"Delete booking data, when plugin deactivated\";i:3701;s:72:\"Check this box to delete all booking data when you uninstal this plugin.\";i:3702;s:29:\"Restore all dismissed windows\";i:3703;s:142:\"You allow unlimited number of bookings per same dates, its can be a reason of double bookings on the same date. Do you really want to do this?\";i:3704;s:86:\"This feature can impact to speed of submitting booking. Do you really want to do this?\";i:3705;s:118:\"You are need to be sure what you are doing. You are disable of loading some JavaScripts Do you really want to do this?\";i:3706;s:121:\"If you check this option, all booking data will be deleted when you uninstall this plugin. Do you really want to do this?\";i:3707;s:15:\"Booking Listing\";i:3708;s:68:\"Email Address will be used in the FROM field of response to Visitor.\";i:3709;s:30:\"Your booking has been approved\";i:3710;s:64:\"Type your email %ssubject%s for the booking confimation message.\";i:3711;s:103:\"Your reservation %s for: %s has been approved.%sYou can edit the booking on this page: %s Thank you, %s\";i:3712;s:57:\"Your booking %s for: %s has been approved.%sThank you, %s\";i:3713;s:175:\"For example: \"You have a new reservation %s on the following date(s): %s Contact information: %s You can approve or cancel this booking at: %s Thank you, Reservation service.\"\";i:3714;s:83:\"Customization of email template, which is sent to Visitor after approval of booking\";i:3715;s:51:\"Email is sent to Visitor after Approval of booking.\";i:3716;s:139:\"Email different from website DNS, its can be a reason of not delivery emails. Please use the email withing the same domain as your website!\";i:3717;s:30:\"Your booking has been declined\";i:3718;s:59:\"Your booking %s for: %s has been  canceled. %sThank you, %s\";i:3719;s:87:\"Customization of email template, which is sent to Visitor after Cancellation of booking\";i:3720;s:51:\"Email is sent to Visitor after Deleting of booking.\";i:3721;s:96:\"Customization of email template, which is sent to Visitor, when booking status is set to Pending\";i:3722;s:54:\"Email is sent to Visitor after booking set as Pending.\";i:3723;s:11:\"New booking\";i:3724;s:171:\"You need to approve a new booking %s for: %s Person detail information:%s Currently a new booking is waiting for approval. Please visit the moderation panel%sThank you, %s\";i:3725;s:3:\"New\";i:3726;s:5:\"admin\";i:3727;s:76:\"Customization of email template, which is sending to Admin after new booking\";i:3728;s:52:\"Email is sending to Admin after creation of booking.\";i:3729;s:142:\"Your reservation %s for: %s is processing now! We will send confirmation by email. %sYou can edit this booking at this page: %s  Thank you, %s\";i:3730;s:99:\"Your reservation %s for: %s is processing now! We will send confirmation by email. %s Thank you, %s\";i:3731;s:7:\"visitor\";i:3732;s:78:\"Customization of email template, which is sending to Visitor after new booking\";i:3733;s:54:\"Email is sending to Visitor after creation of booking.\";i:3734;s:70:\"Email is sent to visitor after cancelling of booking (moved to trash).\";i:3735;s:22:\"Check Premium Features\";i:3736;s:26:\"Upgrade to higher versions\";i:3737;s:24:\"Form Field Configuration\";i:3738;s:21:\"Reset to default form\";i:3739;s:10:\"Form Field\";i:3740;s:4:\"View\";i:3741;s:14:\"Standard Forms\";i:3742;s:19:\"Form under calendar\";i:3743;s:30:\"Form at right side of calendar\";i:3744;s:30:\"Form and calendar are centered\";i:3745;s:24:\"Form for dark background\";i:3746;s:117:\"You can generate the form fields for your form (at the left side) by selection specific field in the above selectbox.\";i:3747;s:70:\"Please read more about the booking form fields configuration %shere%s.\";i:3748;s:349:\"You can reset your active form template by selecting default %sform template%s at the top toolbar. Please select the form template and click on %sReset%s button for resetting only active form (Booking Form or Content of Booking Fields form). Click  on %sBoth%s button if you want to reset both forms: Booking Form and Content of Booking Fields form.\";i:3749;s:33:\"Show / hide field in booking form\";i:3750;s:21:\"Set field as required\";i:3751;s:58:\"Type only %sunique field name%s, that is not using in form\";i:3752;s:6:\"Values\";i:3753;s:44:\"Enter dropdown options. One option per line.\";i:3754;s:4:\"feed\";i:3755;s:23:\"This feature require %s\";i:3756;s:77:\"This feature require %s plugin. You can install %s plugin from this %spage%s.\";i:3757;s:12:\"How it works\";i:3758;s:13:\".ics feed URL\";i:3759;s:41:\"Please enter URL for generating .ics feed\";i:3760;s:57:\"This .ics feed of bookings starting from today for 1 year\";i:3761;s:11:\"Event Title\";i:3762;s:48:\"Select field for assigning to %sevent property%s\";i:3763;s:34:\"Event Description (optional field)\";i:3764;s:8:\"Timezone\";i:3765;s:89:\"Select a city in your required timezone, if you are having problems with dates and times.\";i:3766;s:57:\"Use check in/out time of plugin, during import .ics feeds\";i:3767;s:20:\"Append check out day\";i:3768;s:89:\"Append one check out day, during import .ics feeds, if activated using check in/out times\";i:3769;s:51:\"Assign events fields to specific booking form field\";i:3770;s:5:\"feeds\";i:3771;s:22:\"Enter URL to .ics feed\";i:3772;s:11:\"Choose file\";i:3773;s:15:\"Insert file URL\";i:3774;s:16:\"Upload / Select \";i:3775;s:40:\"What does .ics feeds import/export mean?\";i:3776;s:84:\"Its useful, if you need to import/export bookings from/to external websites, like %s\";i:3777;s:42:\"How to start import of .ics feeds (files)?\";i:3778;s:18:\"Install %s plugin.\";i:3779;s:105:\"Insert %s shortcode into  some post(s) or page(s). Check more info about this %sshortcode configuration%s\";i:3780;s:249:\"Using such shortcodes in pages give a great flexibility to import from  different .ics feeds (sources) into the same resource.%sAlso  its possible to define different CRON parameters for accessing such different pages with  different time intervals.\";i:3781;s:61:\"Or you can import .ics feed or file directly at current page.\";i:3782;s:140:\"If you have inserted import shortcodes from %s, then  you can configure your CRON for periodically access these pages and import .ics feeds.\";i:3783;s:42:\"How to start export of .ics feeds (files)?\";i:3784;s:44:\"Configure ULR feed(s) at this settings page.\";i:3785;s:192:\"Using such URL(s) you can import .ics feeds, from  interface of other websites. %sCheck  more info  about how to import .ics feeds into other websites at the support pages of sepcific website.\";i:3786;s:79:\"Visit these (previously configured URL feeds) pages for downloading .ics files.\";i:3787;s:20:\"Activate auto import\";i:3788;s:81:\"Check this box to %sactivate%s auto import events and creation bookings from them\";i:3789;s:19:\"Import events every\";i:3790;s:40:\"Select time duration of import requests.\";i:3791;s:14:\"Google API Key\";i:3792;s:71:\"Please enter your Google API key. This field required to import events.\";i:3793;s:82:\"You can check in this %sinstruction how to generate and use your Google API key%s.\";i:3794;s:14:\"Maximum number\";i:3795;s:74:\"You can specify the maximum number of events to import during one session.\";i:3796;s:3:\"Now\";i:3797;s:11:\"00:00 today\";i:3798;s:21:\"Start of current week\";i:3799;s:22:\"Start of current month\";i:3800;s:20:\"End of current month\";i:3801;s:17:\"The start of time\";i:3802;s:20:\"Specific date / time\";i:3803;s:47:\"Select option, when to start retrieving events.\";i:3804;s:6:\"Offset\";i:3805;s:17:\"Enter date / time\";i:3806;s:7:\"seconds\";i:3807;s:93:\"You can specify an additional offset from you chosen start point. The offset can be negative.\";i:3808;s:40:\"Type your date in format %s. Example: %s\";i:3809;s:15:\"The end of time\";i:3810;s:5:\"Until\";i:3811;s:46:\"Select option, when to stop retrieving events.\";i:3812;s:61:\"To get Google Calendar API key please follow this instruction\";i:3813;s:35:\"Go to Google Developer Console: %s.\";i:3814;s:44:\"Give your project a name and click \"Create\".\";i:3815;s:38:\"In the sidebar click on \"APIs & auth\".\";i:3816;s:53:\"Click APIs and make sure \"Calendar API\" is set to ON.\";i:3817;s:42:\"Now click on \"Credentials\" in the sidebar.\";i:3818;s:72:\"Under the section \"Public API access\" click the button \"Create new Key\".\";i:3819;s:62:\"On the popup click the button \"Server Key\" and click \"Create\".\";i:3820;s:135:\"You will now see a table loaded with the top item being the API Key. Copy this and paste it into %sGoogle API Key%s field at this page.\";i:3821;s:27:\"Set Your Calendar to Public\";i:3822;s:34:\"Navigate to your Google calendars.\";i:3823;s:35:\"Open the settings for the calendar.\";i:3824;s:37:\"Click the \"Share this Calendar\" link.\";i:3825;s:74:\"Click the checkbox to make calendar public. Do not check the other option.\";i:3826;s:21:\"Find Your Calendar ID\";i:3827;s:151:\"Now copy the Calendar ID to use in the plugin settings in your WordPress admin. Make sure to %suse the Calendar ID only, not the entire XML feed URL%s.\";i:3828;s:29:\"Import Google Calendar Events\";i:3829;s:18:\"Auto import events\";i:3830;s:38:\"Default settings for retrieving events\";i:3831;s:34:\"Google Calendar - General Settings\";i:3832;s:19:\"Booking Admin Panel\";i