(13510, 830, 'additional_information_banners_blok_2_descr', '<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Linens</strong>\r\nWe suggest one bed linen to one bed. The coast of using extra linens is 200 rubles and towel 100 rubles.\r\n<strong>Movie collection</strong>\r\nEach apartment has a flash drive with free movies, on which about 20 interesting movies of different genres. For the flash drive we take 700 rub. deposit and return it when you check-out.\r\n<strong>Wi-fi internet and cable TV</strong>\r\nEach apartment has a memo with a password of Wi-Fi.</p>'),
