(16180, 851, 'additional_information_banners_blok_3_descr', '<strong>Rent of play station</strong>\r\nRent a X-box 360 or Sony Play Station with installed\r\ngames and two joysticks. The cost of rental of 1000 rubles for the first\r\nday and only 100 rubles for each subsequent.\r\n<strong>New bedding set</strong>\r\nFor you, we can buy a new set of bed linen from IKEA size 2 м * 2 м. Linens in new packaging. The cost of this service is only 500 rubles for the entire stay.'),
